        <div class="hx-sol"><span class="hx-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M21 20H3"/></svg></span><h3>Impact without measurement is a story, not a result</h3><p>Without a defined territory, targets and a record of what was collected and carried out, a social initiative produces no data — it produces a narrative.</p><span class="hx-cost">Real cost: impossible to compare, improve or defend the investment the following year.</span></div>
